# Editor / OS
.DS_Store

# NOTE: internal/web/dist is deliberately NOT ignored. The built SPA is
# committed so `go install github.com/jdel/gotracks@latest` produces a binary
# with the web interface embedded. Rebuild with `make ui` and commit the result.
